OL,3,GNEWSAVictorian pub wins award for
OL,4,Apreserving heritage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic pub has been praised for its
OL,7,Fwork in preserving its heritage.
OL,9,FThe Beacon Pub and Hotel in Sedgley is
OL,10,Fhoused in a Grade II-listed building,
OL,11,Fon Bilston Street, and has been serving
OL,12,Fcustomers in the area since 1852.
OL,14,FCampaign for Real Ale (Camra) has
OL,15,Fhonoured the pub as runner-up in the
OL,16,FHeritage Revival Awards, and it will
OL,17,Fappear on Camra's National Inventory
OL,18,Ffor having interiors of national
OL,19,Fheritage importance.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
