OL,3,GNEWSAVictorian pub wins award for
OL,4,Apreserving heritage
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The work at the Beacon is a textbook
OL,7,Fexample of how to expand and improve
OL,8,Fcustomer facilities without any
OL,9,Fdetriment to the historic core," said
OL,10,FPaul Ainsworth, Heritage Pub Revival
OL,11,FAward coordinator.
